      "description": "Papel quase quadrado por atendimento; no celular, amostra da visão diária.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-postit\"><span class=\"ds-note-top\">09:00 <span>Confirmado</span></span><strong>Camila Santos</strong><span class=\"ds-service\">Box Braids</span><span class=\"ds-note-status\">Sinal recebido</span><span class=\"ds-note-bottom\"><span>180 min</span><b>R$ 320,00</b></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-postit{width:100%;min-height:190px;aspect-ratio:1/1.05;height:auto;padding:15px 13px;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-direction:column;position:relative;border:0;border-radius:3px 3px 16px 3px;background:#F4B6DA;color:#111;box-shadow:0 5px 10px -8px #61524255;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;overflow:visible;font-family:var(--body);cursor:pointer}.ds-postit:after{content:'';position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;width:16px;height:16px;background:#0000000c;border-top-left-radius:5px}.ds-postit:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 16px -11px #61524270}.ds-postit:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--pink);outline-offset:4px}.ds-note-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px}.ds-postit>strong{font-family:var(--display);font-size:18px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-service{font-size:14px;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.3}.ds-note-status{font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:9px;opacity:.8}.ds-note-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:auto;padding-top:13px;gap:4px;font-size:11px}.ds-note-bottom b{white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-postit{aspect-ratio:1/1.13;min-height:0;padding:13px 11px}.ds-note-top{margin-bottom:10px}.ds-postit>strong{line-height:1.12}.ds-note-status{margin-top:8px}.ds-note-bottom{padding-top:12px;gap:5px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-postit{transition:none}}"
